UID:personal-management-merit-badge-workshop-20261028@sdicscouting.org
DTSTAMP:20261028T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261028T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261028T193000
SUMMARY:Personal Management MB (1/4)
DESCRIPTION:Personal Management MB\nJA Merit Badge\nScouts map their futur
 e financial goals and how to achieve them through personal finance. After
  completing all three sessions\, scouts will earn their Personal Manageme
 nt Merit Badge!\nThe JA Scout Merit Badge Workshop Series prepares partic
 ipants to consider income\, savings\, debt\, investing\, insurance\, and 
 budgeting to become real-world ready.\nScouts will earn their Personal Ma
 nagement Merit Badge after completing all three sessions.\nParticipants w
 alk away with an understanding of:\nHow to create a budget\nRelationship 
 between income and cost of living\nImportance of saving\nHow credit and l
 oans work\nBasic fundamentals of investing\nWORKSHOP SESSION DATES\nSessi
 on 1: Workbook\n‍\nWed\, October 28\, 2026 from 4:00-7:30 PM\nSession 2
 : Simulation\nWed\, December 9\, 2026 from 4:00-7:30 PM\nSession 3: Testi
 ng\nScouts will select a 1-hour timeslot for their testing\nsession from 
 the following time windows:\nTues\, February 9\, 2027 from 3:00-6:00 PM\n
 Wed\, February 10\, 2027 10 from 3:00-6:00 PM\n\nhttps://www.sdicscouting
 .org/events/personal-management-merit-badge-workshop
URL:https://www.sdicscouting.org/events/personal-management-merit-badge-wo
 rkshop
END:VEVENT
