 irtual Option:\nJoin via Zoom: https://us02web.zoom.us/j/82000370366?pwd=
 VbsLG9eHHdxibJUH6oGXc3HuLvhMKd.1 Meeting ID: 820 0037 0366 Passcode: 0530
 05\nOpen to unit leaders\, committee members\, and anyone interested in h
 elping more families connect with Scouting.\n\nhttps://www.sdicscouting.o
 rg/events/movo-training
