BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:radio-merit-badge-on-uss-midway-november@sdicscouting.org
DTSTAMP:20261107T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261107
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261108
SUMMARY:Radio Merit Badge
DESCRIPTION:Radio Merit Badge\nComplete your Radio Merit Badge aboard the\
 nUSS Midway\nin 2026 on:\nNovember 7\n. Scouts will learn key radio commu
 nication concepts using the EDGE method\, visit the ship’s radio commun
 ications center\, and conduct radio operations from the flight deck.\nRad
 io Merit Badge instruction runs\n8:00 AM–12:00 PM\n\, followed by Scout
 -led Midway Magic from\n12:00–5:00 PM\n. Cost is $20 per Scout\, which 
 includes a full day on the USS Midway.\nFor more information or to regist
 er\, contact Samantha Hunter at\nshunter@midway.org\n.\n\nhttps://www.sdi
 cscouting.org/events/radio-merit-badge-on-uss-midway-november
URL:https://www.sdicscouting.org/events/radio-merit-badge-on-uss-midway-no
 vember
END:VEVENT
