DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261107
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261108
SUMMARY:Cub Scout Leader Training
DESCRIPTION:Cub Scout Leader Training\nTraining for Cub Scout Leaders\nIf 
 you’re a new Cub Scout Leader\, or if you’re an experienced leader wh
 o is taking on a new position\, these courses are for you! Cub Scout Lead
 er Training will show you everything you need to know\, to get started\, 
 about Cub Scouting\, your particular role and responsibilities\, and the 
 resources available to help ensure your success!\nCheck in begins at 7:30
 am and starts at 8am. Class ends at 12pm. Deadline to register is October
  30th\, 2026.\nEmail plcdesigns@hotmail.com with any Special Dietary Need
 s or Allergies.\n\nhttps://www.sdicscouting.org/events/cub-scout-leader-t
 raining
URL:https://www.sdicscouting.org/events/cub-scout-leader-training
END:VEVENT
