DTSTAMP:20261108T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261108
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261109
SUMMARY:Philmont Trek
DESCRIPTION:Philmont Trek\nPlanning a Philmont trek in 2027 or considering
  one in 2028? Join the San Diego-Imperial Council High Adventure Team for
  an afternoon of expert advice\, helpful discussions\, and preparation ti
 ps. Topics include gear\, travel\, cooking\, training\, meal planning\, c
 rew dynamics\, and health and safety.\nOpen to 2027 and 2028 Trek Advisor
 s and adult leaders interested in Philmont. To RSVP\, contact Laura Carti
 er.\n‍\n\nhttps://www.sdicscouting.org/events/philmont-trek
URL:https://www.sdicscouting.org/events/philmont-trek
