 org
DTSTAMP:20270201T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270201T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270201T193000
SUMMARY:Personal Management MB (1/4)
DESCRIPTION:Personal Management MB\nJA Merit Badge\nScouts map their futur
 e financial goals and how to achieve them through personal finance. After
  completing all three sessions\, scouts will earn their Personal Manageme
 nt Merit Badge!\nThe JA Scout Merit Badge Workshop Series prepares partic
 ipants to consider income\, savings\, debt\, investing\, insurance\, and 
 budgeting to become real-world ready.\nScouts will earn their Personal Ma
 nagement Merit Badge after completing all three sessions.\nParticipants w
 alk away with an understanding of:\nHow to create a budget\nRelationship 
 between income and cost of living\nImportance of saving\nHow credit and l
 oans work\nBasic fundamentals of investing\nWorkshop Series Details:\nSes
 sion 1: Workbook – Monday\, February 1\, 2027 from 4:00-7:30 PM\nSessio
 n 2: Simulation – Monday\, March 15\, 2027 from 4:00-7:30 PM\nSession 3
 : Testing – Scouts will select a 1-hour timeslot for their testing sess
 ion from the following time windows:\nMonday\, May 10\, 2027 from 3:00-6:
 00 PM\nTuesday\, May 11\, 2027 10 from 3:00-6:00 PM\nThis workshop is ope
 n to scouts ages 11-17.\nFor questions about this workshop\, please conta
 ct Marley Gang at\nmgang@jasandiego.org\n.\n\nhttps://www.sdicscouting.or
 g/events/spring-personal-management-merit-badge-workshop
URL:https://www.sdicscouting.org/events/spring-personal-management-merit-b
 adge-workshop
END:VEVENT
