BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:swamp-base-2027@sdicscouting.org
DTSTAMP:20270618T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270618
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270624
SUMMARY:Swamp Base 2027
DESCRIPTION:Swamp Base 2027\nThis is not your typical vacation. This is a 
 challenge. You will need to overcome fears\, do the unthinkable\, and you
  will be better because of it.\nThis is Swamp Base. This is high adventur
 e.\nSan Diego-Imperial Council is sending a contingent of scouts to the S
 wamp Base in Louisiana. The excursion ventures through remote swamplands 
 and caters to Scouts and registered adult leaders. We will be sending 2 c
 rews that depart the same day.\nIf you're looking to experience all that 
 you've heard about the swamp\, then this experience is for you! A 61.6-mi
 le high adventure canoe trek through the western side of the Atchafalaya 
 Swamp. It takes place over 6-days and 6-nights. The trek includes challen
 ging tests of endurance with specific lessons about the environments\, cu
 ltures\, food\, and communities of the Atchafalaya and South Louisiana.\n
 PARTICIPANT ELIGIBILITY\nMust be a registered Scouts BSA\, Venture Scout\
 , Sea Scout\, or Adult Leader.\nMust be 13 years old on or before their t
 rek Arrival Day.\nMust pass the BSA Swim Test as a SWIMMER or BEGINNER be
 fore arrival.\nMust be in good health as evidenced by the BSA Health Form
 .\n\nhttps://www.sdicscouting.org/events/swamp-base-2027
URL:https://www.sdicscouting.org/events/swamp-base-2027
END:VEVENT
