UID:cub-scout-resident-camp@sdicscouting.org
DTSTAMP:20270707T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270707
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270711
SUMMARY:Cub Scout Resident Camp
DESCRIPTION:Cub Scout Resident Camp\nCub Scouts will enjoy fun and challen
 ging experiences in boating\, swimming\, range & target activities\, camp
 ing\, crafts\, nature\, and Scout skills.\nOur\nCamp Activities\nemphasiz
 e fun in the outdoors and are designed for all Cub Scout ranks and skills
 .\nRegister TODAY! Don't miss out on this opportunity!\nAttend as a Pack\
 , Den (Webelos/AOLs)\, or individual Scout(s) with parent/guardian.\nA mi
 nimum of 2 adult leaders must accompany a Pack / Den (Webelos/AOLs) to ca
 mp\, and units must maintain a 4:1 ratio of youth to adults. Individual s
 couts(s) with parent/guardian registration must still meet the 4:1 ratio.
 \nThis camping experience is designed for Scouts entering 1st - 5th grade
  only. (Tiger - AOL) No siblings.\nCamp starts Wednesday afternoon\, with
  arrival anytime after 1 pm\, and ends Wednesday at 10 am.\nThe first mea
 l is Wednesday dinner\, so please each lunch before you arrive.\nPrice\n:
  $350 per Scout\, $200 per adult.\n\nhttps://www.sdicscouting.org/events/
 cub-scout-resident-camp
URL:https://www.sdicscouting.org/events/cub-scout-resident-camp
LOCATION:Mataguay Scout Ranch\, 27955 CA-79\, Santa Ysabel\, CA 92076
END:VEVENT
